{# Age of AI — "your episode is live" note to the guest
   (sent by pipelines/voices/publish_episode.py when wired to email;
   currently the Slack ping is the live notification). #}
<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;color:#1a202c;line-height:1.6">
  <h2 style="color:#7C3AED">Your episode is live</h2>
  <p>Hi {{ guest_name }},</p>
  <p>Episode {{ episode_number }} of The Age of AI — your conversation with
  Mira — is out now:</p>
  <p><a href="{{ episode_url }}" style="color:#7C3AED">{{ episode_url }}</a></p>
  <p>Thank you for lending the show your voice and your candor. Share it
  anywhere you like — and if anything needs correcting post-publish, just
  reply to this email.</p>
  <p>— The Age of AI, Nerra Network</p>
</div>
